      "Gutters are real role=\"separator\" keyboard controls: Tab reaches them and arrow/Home/End resize. [at Splitter/engines/modern/index.tsx:17]",
      "aria-valuenow reports the leading panel's percentage and must fall inside the advertised range. [at Splitter/engines/modern/index.tsx:172]",
      "A fully collapsed panel is aria-hidden AND inert, so focus can never land on hidden content. [at Splitter/engines/modern/index.tsx:26]",
      "Collapsing to zero is guarded against the state where a panel would remain visible while aria-valuenow reads 0. [at Splitter/engines/modern/index.tsx:199]",
      "aria-keyshortcuts advertises the exact key set for the orientation ('ArrowUp ArrowDown Home End' vs 'ArrowLeft ArrowRight Home End'). [at Splitter/engines/modern/index.tsx:483-484]",
      "Pointer-down handlers are attached only when the gutter is operable, and the pointer-up path clears the drag state rather than leaving data-dragging set. [at Splitter/engines/modern/index.tsx:486]"
